{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>iKun Crush</strong>\u00a0a hilarious casual game that wildly stitches together the &quot;Kun-style meme universe&quot; with classic match-3 gameplay!When &quot;Basketball,&quot; &quot;You Bing(Oil Cake),&quot; and &quot;Bao Guo(A person's name)&quot; fill the puzzle board,and the remixed &quot;Ji Ni Tai Mei&quot; BGM loops nonstop,you\u2019ll unlock a brand-new way to enjoy Kun-style memes in an experience where laughter and quick reflexes fly hand in hand!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay: Match-3 , Memes , Every Move is a Meme</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modified Match-3, Meme Power Maxed Out</strong>: <br>Classic match-3 rules lay the foundation, but every &quot;match tile&quot; hides a surprise \u2014<br><strong>Basketball Bomb</strong>:Chain matches trigger screen-clearing blasts, sending basketballs flying everywhere for a crazy, satisfying rush! <br><strong>Oil Cake Obstacle</strong>:Failing to clear &quot;Oil Cakes&quot; in time triggers a chain reaction, watching them flood the screen in absurdity! <br><strong>Bao Guo Interference</strong>:Suddenly appearing &quot;Bao Guo&quot; tiles disrupt your matches \u2014 counter them to make them plummet into the board\u2019s abyss!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parade of Meme Elements</strong>:<br><strong>Over 50 Kun-style plot elements</strong> \u2014\u2014 meme images,the &quot;69-year-old elder&quot; map, the &quot;Lightning Five-Whiplash&quot; meme, microphone props\u2026even hidden &quot;Ji Ni&quot; voice easter eggs. Longtime fans will feel their DNA tremble at the sight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BGM: Earworm Loops That Won\u2019t Quit</strong>: <br>Two remixed Kun-style BGMs are built in,automatically switching when you toggle between &quot;Little Blackie&quot; and &quot;Brother Kun&quot; characters.The more you play, the more addicted you get \u2014 you simply can\u2019t stop!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918180?t=1757151271","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918180?t=1757151271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918180/d6e9cd5e47818f853ebc479e45772dc0dad57bc6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757151271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918180/d6e9cd5e47818f853ebc479e45772dc0dad57bc6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757151271","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>iKun Crush</strong>\u00a0a hilarious casual game that wildly stitches together the &quot;Kun-style meme universe&quot; with classic match-3 gameplay!When &quot;Basketball,&quot; &quot;You Bing(Oil Cake),&quot; and &quot;Bao Guo(A person's name)&quot; fill the puzzle board,and the remixed &quot;Ji Ni Tai Mei&quot; BGM loops nonstop,you\u2019ll unlock a brand-new way to enjoy Kun-style memes in an experience where laughter and quick reflexes fly hand in hand!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay: Match-3 , Memes , Every Move is a Meme</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modified Match-3, Meme Power Maxed Out</strong>: <br>Classic match-3 rules lay the foundation, but every &quot;match tile&quot; hides a surprise \u2014<br><strong>Basketball Bomb</strong>:Chain matches trigger screen-clearing blasts, sending basketballs flying everywhere for a crazy, satisfying rush! <br><strong>Oil Cake Obstacle</strong>:Failing to clear &quot;Oil Cakes&quot; in time triggers a chain reaction, watching them flood the screen in absurdity! <br><strong>Bao Guo Interference</strong>:Suddenly appearing &quot;Bao Guo&quot; tiles disrupt your matches \u2014 counter them to make them plummet into the board\u2019s abyss!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parade of Meme Elements</strong>:<br><strong>Over 50 Kun-style plot elements</strong> \u2014\u2014 meme images,the &quot;69-year-old elder&quot; map, the &quot;Lightning Five-Whiplash&quot; meme, microphone props\u2026even hidden &quot;Ji Ni&quot; voice easter eggs. Longtime fans will feel their DNA tremble at the sight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BGM: Earworm Loops That Won\u2019t Quit</strong>: <br>Two remixed Kun-style BGMs are built in,automatically switching when you toggle between &quot;Little Blackie&quot; and &quot;Brother Kun&quot; characters.The more you play, the more addicted you get \u2014 you simply can\u2019t stop!</p></li></ul>","developers":["MiaoGame"],"dlc":[3964060],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918180/19352365e59a022ce37478ee180381d205b50f2e/header.jpg?t=1757151271","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3918180/1606639488/71abf3650868e55539e857215134e8acd308a4ac/1755354691/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755738194","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3918180/1606639488/71abf3650868e55539e857215134e8acd308a4ac/1755354691/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755738194","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3918180/1606639488/71abf36